 &lt;p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100"&gt;인터랙티브 레슨 데모&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>중첩 객체와 배열 확장</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m02-template-basics/m02-l02-nested-path/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m02-template-basics/m02-l02-nested-path/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bind nested properties with dotted paths such as &lt;code&gt;{{ds.buyer.address.city}}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand array rows with collection fields such as &lt;code&gt;{{ds.items.sku}}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know that numeric indexes like &lt;code&gt;items.0.sku&lt;/code&gt; are &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; the engine path — use expansion (Module 04) for layout control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;aside
