 &lt;p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100"&gt;인터랙티브 레슨 데모&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>식과 수식 셀</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m02-template-basics/m02-l03-expression/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m02-template-basics/m02-l03-expression/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bind input cells with mustache markers while leaving &lt;strong&gt;Excel formulas&lt;/strong&gt; for derived values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefer engine-side expressions only when the template engine documents them; otherwise keep math in native Excel formulas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert once and open the workbook to see formulas still live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
